# Windows Server Home Lab

Hi! I'm **Bernard**, an IT Support professional from the Philippines.

I created this repository to document my hands-on journey into **Windows Server administration, Active Directory, networking, and IT infrastructure**.

I currently work in IT support and have gained experience troubleshooting end-user issues, Microsoft 365, Active Directory, Entra ID, Intune, networking, VPNs, and various IT support platforms.

While I have learned a lot through real-world helpdesk experience, I wanted to strengthen my technical foundation by building my own lab environment and practicing these technologies from the ground up.

---

## Why I Built This Lab

My goal is to move beyond simply knowing how to troubleshoot individual tickets and develop a deeper understanding of how the infrastructure behind those tickets actually works.

This lab gives me a safe environment where I can:

- Break things
- Troubleshoot problems
- Test configurations
- Practice administration
- Document what I learn
- Build practical experience

Everything in this repository represents something I have practiced, configured, or learned during my lab journey.

---

## Lab Environment

The lab is being built using:

- VMware Workstation
- Windows Server
- Windows 11
- Active Directory Domain Services
- DNS
- DHCP
- Group Policy
- PowerShell

